摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness plugin: open WSL Linux paths from chat in Windows.","id":"gh:1347958944","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-wsl-open","slug":"173787247/dsh-wsl-open","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","wsl"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness plugin: open WSL Linux paths from chat in Windows."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-wsl-open\n> **Install set:** part of dsh-wsl-kit. Prefer `KIT_SET=daily` | `llm` | `github` | `"},{"id":"p2s2","text":"full` (see kit README). Fault tree: TROUBLESHOOTING.md."},{"id":"p3s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness plugin: click a **WSL Linux path** in chat to open it on **Windows** (default app, "},{"id":"p3s2","text":"or Explorer for folders)."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Part of **dsh-wsl-kit**."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"中文说明 → README.zh.md"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Where it sits"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Opens a Linux path in Windows Explorer or the default Windows app."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Suite diagram and version snapshot: dsh-wsl-kit. This plugin is **0.2.0** (daily; also in llm). Do n"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ot copy that matrix into this README."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| Field | Value |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| **Plugin** | `dsh-wsl-open` **0.2.0** |\n| **Minimum dsh** | ≥ **0.1.2** (web UI one-shot `?token=`"},{"id":"p12s2","text":" on Windows relay `:3081`) |\n| **Latest verified** | See dsh-wsl-kit Compatibility (currently **`0.2"},{"id":"p12s3","text":".2-rc.1`**) — single source of truth for the suite |\n| **Kit set** | `daily` (also in `github` / `fu"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"ll`; fetch+net also in `llm`) |\n| **Cloud Flash** | Use model id **`deepseek-flash`** (V4.1 Flash) i"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"n `~/.dsh/settings.yaml` / `llm-deepseek` — not configured by this plugin |\n| **Agent Teams** | Upst"},{"id":"p12s6","text":"ream experimental; not required here |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Suite floor versions: kit `check-plugin-versions.sh`. Fault tree: TROUBLESHOOTING.md."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Why"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Chat does not turn `/home/.../deck.pptx` into a useful link. Generic “open path” plugins often call "},{"id":"p15s2","text":"Linux `xdg-open`, which cannot launch Windows Office / WPS."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## What it does"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"1. Highlights absolute Linux paths in assistant text (CSS Highlight; does not rewrite React DOM)\n2. "},{"id":"p17s2","text":"Maps with `wslpath -w` (or a fallback) to `\\\\wsl$\\<distro>\\...` or `C:\\...`\n3. Files → `cmd.exe /c s"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"tart` (Windows default app); folders → `explorer.exe`"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Only opens real paths under home, the session workspace, and `/mnt/c/Users` (and `/mnt/d/Users`). No"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"n-WSL hosts skip open."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Prefer this for **files/folders**. Use dsh-wsl-launch for apps, and dsh-wsl-browser for `http(s)` UR"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"fer this for **files/folders**. Use dsh-wsl-launch for apps, and dsh-wsl-browser for `http(s)` URLs."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Restart `dsh web`, refresh the page. Click a dotted-underline path in a **new or re-rendered** assis"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"web`, refresh the page. Click a dotted-underline path in a **new or re-rendered** assistant message."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Verify"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"1. Ask the agent to write a file under `/home/<you>/...` (e.g. `.pptx`).\n2. The absolute path should"},{"id":"p24s2","text":" be dotted-underlined.\n3. Click it — Windows opens with the default app."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Debug: browser console `[dsh-wsl-open]`; host log `dsh-wsl-open: loaded distro=...`."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Config"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":